# Design tier gate (BSOD Analyzer)

**Upgrade hub:** `C:\Users\binar\OneDrive\Desktop\BSODAnalyzer\docs\upgrade\README.md`

Process: [`docs/upgrade/DESIGN_TIERS.md`](../../docs/upgrade/DESIGN_TIERS.md)

## Do not implement from design artifacts

| Path | Tier | Agent may |
|---|---|-----|
| `docs/upgrade/inbox/` | 1 Exploration | Read; update when user asks |
| `docs/upgrade/plans/` | 3 Design | Read; update PLAN when user asks — **no production code** |
| `docs/upgrade/plans/spikes/` | 3 POC | Isolated spikes — **never import into source tree** |
| [`ROADMAP.md`](../../docs/ROADMAP.md) § **Approved intent** | 2 Intent | Read only — **not buildable** |
| `docs/upgrade/parked/` | Parked | Read **only when user asks** |

**Do not read Parked** on default scans. **Do not** treat Exploration or Approved intent as buildable.

## Build requires

1. **ROADMAP work queue** (not Approved intent alone)
2. `docs/upgrade/plans/*_PLAN.md` when slice is upgrade-related
3. User: **implement Phase X** — [`BUILD_HANDOFF.md`](../../docs/upgrade/BUILD_HANDOFF.md)

